body: "## Source\\n\\nGitHub #1140: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1140\\n\\n## Scope\\n\\nOwn one SDK-level grammar and mutation contract for file and test entries across create, update, dedicated CLI commands, MCP, and public SDK adapters. A comma-bearing value without an explicit leading key must never silently become an unusable path or command. Literal commas remain expressible through explicit keyed or JSON input.\\n\\n## Context integrity\\n\\nProject management equals context management: linked artifacts are executable context, so a successful mutation receipt must not certify a path that cannot resolve or a test command that cannot run solely because an advertised tuple form was parsed as plaintext."
